  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">KGZ TF Cap Build PFM</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">KGZ TF Cap Build PFM</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syfet med MDTF &#xe4;r att st&#xe4;rka Kirgizistans regerings effektivitet och ansvar f&#xf6;r offentlig finansiell styrning samt implementering av reformer inom omr&#xe5;det. Fonden kommer vara &#xf6;ppen i 4 &#xe5;r, men Sidas st&#xf6;d upph&#xf6;r i och med utfasningen i december 2010.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective for the MDTF is to assist the Government of Kyrgysztan in strengthening the effectiveness, efficiency and accountability of public financial management as well as implementation of public financial management reform. The Fund will be running for 4 years but Sida&#xb4;s support virtually ends in December 2010 due to phase out.</narrative>
  </description>
